      "content": "but a \"quiet corner\" doesn't change the fact that i'm just a burden on myself. it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy feeling around for no reason. if life is just about finding a place to hide, then maybe it would be easier to just stop dragging it around altogether. like, if i'm already invisible, wouldn't it be more peaceful to just let that happen?",
